  "vv33:99.3": "…pe… abhikkantena vaṇṇena yā tvaṃ tiṭṭhasi devate, obhāsenti disā sabbā osadhī viya tārakā. kena te tādiso vaṇṇo kena te idhamijjhati, uppajjanti ca te bhogā ye keci manaso piyā. pucchāmi taṃ devi mahānubhāve manussabhūtā kimakāsi puññaṃ kenāsi evaṃ ",
  "vv33:100.0": "",
  "vv33:100.1": "jalitānubhāvā vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatīti. sā devatā attamanā moggallānena pucchitā pañhaṃ puṭṭhā viyākāsi yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. sakkhaliṃ ahamadāsiṃ ",
  "vv33:100.2": "bhikkhuno piṇḍāya carantassa ",
  "vv33:100.3": "evaṃ karitvā kammaṃ sugatiṃ upapajja modāmi. ",
  "vv33:101.1": "tassā me passa vimānaṃ ",
  "vv33:101.2": "accharā kāmavaṇṇinīhamasmi ",
  "vv33:101.3": "accharā sahassassāhaṃ ",
  "vv33:101.4": "pavarā passa puññānaṃ vipākaṃ. ",
  "vv33:102.1": "tena me tādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv33:102.2": "tena me idhamijjhati, uppajjanti ca me bhogā ye keci manaso piyā. akkhāmi te bhikkhu mahānubhāva manussabhūtā yamakāsi puññaṃ tenamhi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā ",
  "vv33:102.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatīti. ",
  "vv33:103.1": "svāgataṃ vata me ajja ",
  "vv33:103.2": "suppabhātaṃ suvuṭṭhitaṃ ",
  "vv33:103.3": "yaṃ addasaṃ devatāyo ",
  "vv33:103.4": "accharā kāmavaṇṇiyo ",
  "vv33:104.1": "imāhaṃ dhammaṃ sutvā ",
  "vv33:104.2": "kāhāmi kusalaṃ bahuṃ ",
  "vv33:104.3": "dānena samacarīyāyaṃ ",
  "vv33:104.4": "saññamena damena ca ",
  "vv33:104.5": "svāhaṃ tattha gamissāmi ",
  "vv33:104.6": "yattha gantvā na socareti. ",
